        <User classid="UserCmp" name="master:annotation" id="748181448" x="1062" y="234" w="126" h="20" z="-1" orient="0" defn="master:annotation" link="-1" q="4" disable="false">
          <paramlist link="-1" name="" crc="5338603">
            <param name="AL1" value="Connect IBR POI here" />
            <param name="AL2" value="" />
          </paramlist>
        </User>
        <Sticky classid="Sticky" id="859263480" x="1116" y="342" w="450" h="522" colors="0, 15792890">
          <paramlist>
            <param name="full_font" value="Tahoma, 9pt" />
            <param name="align" value="0" />
            <param name="style" value="1" />
            <param name="font" value="1" />
            <param name="fg_color" value="0" />
            <param name="bg_color" value="8454016" />
            <param name="arrows" value="0" />
            <param name="opacity" value="25" />
            <param name="fg_color_adv" value="#FF000000" />
            <param name="bg_color_adv" value="#FF80FF80" />
            <param name="hl_color_adv" value="#FFFFFF00" />
            <param name="bdr_color_adv" value="#FF95918C" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[~~~~~~~~ CUSTOMIZING TESTS ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

The test profile can be customized by editing the corresponding .txt file:

1.  Flatstart: automatically handled
2.  LVRT		profile_LVRT.txt
3.  HVRT 		profile_HVRT.txt
4.  V-down 		profile_VDW.txt
5.  V-up 		profile_VUP.txt
6. LVRT(2800)	2800_LVRT_WGR.txt  (or)   2800_LVRT_PVGR.txt
7. LVRT(2800 piece)	2800_LVRT_WGR2.txt  (or)   2800_LVRT_PVGR2.txt
8. HVRT (2800)		2800_HVRT.txt
9. HVRT w/ Transient:  See transient block within PMView
10. Angle down		profile_ADW.txt
11. Angle up		profile_AUP.txt
12. Hz Down		profile_HzDW.txt
13. Hz Up		profile_HzUP.txt
14. SCR:  profile_SCR.txt  (Right-click SCR block within PMView to adjust settings.)
15. PMU_playback	PMU_data.txt

16. AGS-ESR: small voltage disturbance
17. AGS-ESR: frequency change+inertia
18. System Strength - SCR
19. Phase Angle Jump
20. Loss of synch. machine - Disch.
21. Loss of synch. machine - Chrg.
22. Loss of synch. machine - Dupl. Pmax

Profiles 6 and 7 use either file depending on whether "Wind" or "Solar" is selected in the PMView block parameter settings (right-click the yellow PMView block, edit parameters).]]></Sticky>
        <Sticky classid="Sticky" id="794677864" x="72" y="468" w="738" h="972" colors="0, 15792890">
          <paramlist>
            <param name="full_font" value="Tahoma, 9pt" />
            <param name="align" value="0" />
            <param name="style" value="1" />
            <param name="font" value="1" />
            <param name="fg_color" value="0" />
            <param name="bg_color" value="8454016" />
