10.  Angle down
11.  Angle up
12.  Frequency Down
13.  Frequency Up
14.  Short Ckt Ratio SCR
15.  PMU playback

16. AGS-ESR: small voltage disturbance
17. AGS-ESR: frequency change+inertia
18. System Strength - SCR
19. Phase Angle Jump
20. Loss of synch. machine - Disch.
21. Loss of synch. machine - Chrg.
22. Loss of synch. machine - Dupl. Pmax]]></Sticky>
